usage: paritydesk artifacts <status|plan|ingest|allow|skip|forget|import-legacy>

Keep claude.ai artifacts the same on every profile (beta)

commands:
  allow         Decide about one artifact (Terminal only)
  forget        Stop tracking an artifact (Terminal only)
  import-legacy Import the artifact archive of an earlier folder-swap script
  ingest        Record a finished sync round now
  plan          Preview what a sync on a profile would do (approximate)
  skip          Stop syncing an artifact (it stays in the archive)
  status        Show the artifact archive

global flags:
  --app-support-dir string     paritydesk support directory
  --ascii                      ASCII only
  --config string              config file (also PARITYDESK_CONFIG)
  --json                       print one JSON document
  --no-color                   no colour (also NO_COLOR, TERM=dumb)
  --plain                      plain lines, no tables or spinners
  --read-only                  plan only; never write (also PARITYDESK_READONLY=1)
  --state-dir string           state directory (also PARITYDESK_STATE_DIR)
